       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. PRINTN.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01 WS-INP1-VAL PIC 99 VALUE 0.
        01 WS-N PIC 999 VALUE 1.
        01 WS-CNT PIC 99 VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
            DISPLAY "START".
            ACCEPT WS-INP1-VAL.
            MOVE 1 TO WS-CNT
            
            PERFORM UNTIL WS-CNT IS EQUAL WS-INP1-VAL + 1
                    DISPLAY WS-CNT
                    COMPUTE WS-CNT = WS-CNT + 1
            END-PERFORM.
            STOP RUN.
